dy's\n`if` merge is mistaken for the loop-carried value. `$SP/boolD` shows the same for\n`for (x in m.iterator()) d += x ? 1 : 0`. FIX SHAPE: give this path the same slot machinery the\nhandle loop uses (collect modified vars, alloc slots, reload at body start, store back at body end).\n\nSee [[bugs-null-reference-receivers-and-map-formatting]] (the Bool item is this defect, not a\nconversion bug — element conversion was always right).\n\n---\nArchived from Claude memory `bugs_loop_body_conditional_update_and_exit_phi` on 2026-10-18. A record of past work; open items in it may have their own issues.","files":null}]}